Constraint, tidyCoeffs, tidy, tidy?]\n  split <;> rename_i hp\n  · split <;> rename_i hn\n    · simp_all\n    · rcases normalize?_eq_some hn with ⟨rfl, rfl⟩\n      exact normalize_sat w\n  · rcases positivize?_eq_some hp with ⟨rfl, rfl⟩\n    exact normalize_sat (positivize_sat w)","start":353,"end":361},"axioms":["Quot.sound","propext"]}